  #line-at(72.024pt, 330.29pt, "steady state conditions and the growth within the cavity is seldom relevant, therefore this relationship ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 344.69pt, "may not be of much significance to the boiling system designer. Furthermore, for quasi-steady state ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 359.21pt, "design, the cavity depth was found to be of potentially little influence depending on the surface ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 373.73pt, "superheat. Narayan et al. [13] showed that for low superheats (")
